# FlashBench sources - @Dev_DcS
#
# name | kind | source | ref | pin | watch | filter | hold
#
# kind    git = shallow clone of <ref>, HEAD must equal <pin> (commit)
#         tar/zip/apk = download <source>, sha256 must equal <pin>
#         local = directory in this repo
# watch   repo polled for new releases ("-" = same as source)
# filter  ERE for release tags, branch:<name> to follow a branch head,
#         or index:<ERE with one group> to read versions off a download page
# hold    if set, updates are reported as held with this reason

