# on-device shell comforts: a full busybox applet set and the nano editor.
# both are vendored prebuilts (static NDK builds), pinned by sha/commit so the
# file can never change under us. these are the "busybox-ndk" and "nano-ndk"
# osm0sis builds; held from the watcher because their repos are archived.
busybox|raw|https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Magisk-Modules-Repo/busybox-ndk/ad6700620120e3c475df05b0f8bfa7a40e741ee0/busybox-arm64|1.36.1|c629fce4b0dd3ba9775f851d0941e74582115f423258d3a79800f2bd11d30f5c|-|-|vendored prebuilt, upstream repo archived
